.el .ds Aq '
.TH dalgon-dev-journal-sidecar 1  "dalgon-dev-journal-sidecar " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-dev\-journal\-sidecar \- List or dump the sidecar files in a session directory.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon dev journal sidecar\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDIR\fR> [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List or dump the sidecar files in a session directory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDIR\fR>
The session directory holding journal.jsonl and its sidecars
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Dump one sidecar instead of listing them
